          "content": "**B**\n\n**Explanation:** \nThis choice produces a greater net balance of overall well-being over suffering. Due to the diminishing marginal utility of wealth, the $5,000 provides far greater benefit by eliminating the acute anxiety, compounding penalties, and prolonged deprivation of severe debt than the harm it causes to a financially secure individual who merely has to postpone a luxury vacation without losing any basic necessities. When considering the overall distribution of happiness and distress, transferring the resource maximizes total welfare.",
